---
flowchart LR
  accTitle: bevy_app::Inherited#lt;ui_node::ComputedUiRenderTargetInfo#gt; · 对象关系
  accDescr: 当前对象及全部直接关联对象。
  %% n*/e* 是业务节点/关系，sc* 是阶段关系；layout_* 仅用于排版。
  classDef node_system fill:#EFF3F8,stroke:#3567A6,stroke-width:1.6px,color:#1F3340
  classDef node_component fill:#F1F5F2,stroke:#4B8060,stroke-width:1.6px,color:#1F3340
  classDef edge_read stroke:#3567A6,stroke-width:1.6px,stroke-dasharray:6 4
  classDef edge_write stroke:#2F7161,stroke-width:1.8px
  classDef edge_reference stroke:#7B4DB2,stroke-width:1.5px,stroke-dasharray:6 4
  classDef external_node stroke-dasharray:6 4
  n0@{ shape: rounded, label: "**bevy​_​app::Inherited#lt;ui​_​node::**<br/>**ComputedUiRenderTargetInfo#gt;**<br/>保存层级传播算法继承到当前节点的中间组件<br/>值" }
  class n0 node_component
  n1@{ shape: rounded, label: "**bevy​_​app::propagate::propagate​_​**<br/>**output#lt;bevy​_​ui::ui​_​node::**<br/>**ComputedUiRenderTargetInfo, ()#gt;**<br/>把继承结果写入或移出实体实际组件。" }
  class n1 node_system
  n2@{ shape: rounded, label: "**bevy​_​app::propagate::propagate​_​**<br/>**inherited#lt;bevy​_​ui::ui​_​node::**<br/>**ComputedUiRenderTargetInfo, (),**<br/>**bevy​_​ecs::hierarchy::ChildOf#gt;**<br/>沿关系层级传播变化的继承组件值。" }
  class n2 node_system
  n3@{ shape: rounded, label: "**bevy​_​app::propagate::update​_​**<br/>**source#lt;bevy​_​ui::ui​_​node::**<br/>**ComputedUiRenderTargetInfo, (),**<br/>**bevy​_​ecs::hierarchy::ChildOf#gt;**<br/>同步传播源并恢复移除来源后的继承状态。" }
  class n3 node_system
  n4@{ shape: rounded, label: "**bevy​_​app::propagate::update​_​removed​_​**<br/>**limit#lt;bevy​_​ui::ui​_​node::**<br/>**ComputedUiRenderTargetInfo, (),**<br/>**bevy​_​ecs::hierarchy::ChildOf#gt;**<br/>在传播限制移除后重新标记继承链。" }
